#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/qvc-qnn/extracted-outputs/ac9e4239-8c1a-4798-a8e7-80347c29150c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/qvc-qnn/extracted-outputs/ac9e4239-8c1a-4798-a8e7-80347c29150c-0.avif)\n"

